  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported envelope detail/all-detail queries, ordinary load-combination coefficient retrieval and two buckling availability/count observations with complete matching XML IntelliSense. Added detached envelope/combination models, strict statuses and written-output validation, bounded memberships and count rechecks. Preserved signed coefficients and zero-pair null behavior; returned SRSS overall multipliers raise NotSupportedException. Retained shared constructing-thread/current-binding guards and independent results. See the load-definition and buckling guides for exact contracts and qualification limits.",
